WEBVTT

00:15.880 --> 00:17.880
What am I, stupid?

00:17.880 --> 00:20.880
Inukai-san would never get me
anything for Valentine's Day...

00:20.880 --> 00:23.210
Didn't get any chocolate today?

00:25.330 --> 00:27.250
Down here, boy.

00:29.500 --> 00:31.710
I'm glad I caught you.

00:31.710 --> 00:34.330
I've got chocolate here
with your name on it.

00:35.630 --> 00:38.040
These are from Inukai-kun.

00:38.040 --> 00:39.540
They're for you.

00:46.920 --> 00:50.250
Holy crap! I got chocolate from Inukai-san!

00:53.130 --> 00:58.790
But why'd she ask another girl
to give it to me?

00:59.580 --> 01:02.210
Was she just shy?

01:05.750 --> 01:07.210
Damn, it's good!

01:10.540 --> 01:13.080
I shouldn't scarf it down all at once..

01:13.080 --> 01:16.540
I'll just wrap it back up
and save some for later.

01:17.790 --> 01:19.790
Okay, perfect.

01:20.330 --> 01:21.330
Huh?!

01:22.250 --> 01:24.750
Wh... What the...

01:24.750 --> 01:27.130
Why am I so dizzy?

01:27.710 --> 01:29.170
What's...

01:32.670 --> 01:34.000
...happening?

01:36.380 --> 01:39.330
Keep your eyes on me! You're my sweet good boy!

01:39.330 --> 01:42.500
When I'm with you life is w-w-wonderful!

01:42.500 --> 01:45.630
1, 2, 3, now jump! Affectionate attention

01:45.630 --> 01:48.710
3, 2, 1, now turn! So many hot sparks

01:48.710 --> 01:51.880
1-to-1, now love! Unfortunate fraction

01:51.880 --> 01:54.960
From wonderful morning till night,
I'll give you everything

01:54.960 --> 01:58.040
Tell me how much you love me, my little boy

01:58.040 --> 02:01.630
Love me! Love me! Let me love you, I want you

02:02.170 --> 02:07.960
Live your life!
Sprint forward with all you've got!

02:07.960 --> 02:14.630
At the finish line is a new you
(Go beyond yourself!)

02:14.630 --> 02:20.420
Howl loud and proud!
Yesterday might have beaten you down

02:20.420 --> 02:23.460
But tomorrow (Affectionate Attention)
you and I (Unfortunate Fraction)

02:23.460 --> 02:27.710
Will shine as bright as we can!

02:27.710 --> 02:29.210
This is your life, your way!

02:29.330 --> 02:30.880
This is my life, my way!

02:31.000 --> 02:31.880
Woof!

02:37.330 --> 02:38.830
Inukai-san?

02:37.710 --> 02:41.380
<b>The "Come Home" Test.</b>

02:47.080 --> 02:48.710
Inukai-san...

02:50.420 --> 02:52.170
I remember now!

02:52.170 --> 02:54.380
It was the girl in the labcoat at school!

02:54.670 --> 02:58.580
Eating the chocolate she gave me
turned me into a dog!

02:59.460 --> 03:03.500
Now I'm pretty sure they weren't
from Inukai-san. She just lied.

03:04.130 --> 03:06.330
I have to find that girl again!

03:11.290 --> 03:14.040
Hey, Pochita, you awake, sleepy boy?

03:14.040 --> 03:15.380
Good!

03:17.790 --> 03:20.290
I'm back in Tsukishiro's room?

03:20.290 --> 03:22.920
I must've been pretty exhausted
to just pass out...

03:24.920 --> 03:30.000
Wait, so how did you know
Pochita was here, Karen?

03:30.000 --> 03:31.960
I put a tracker on him.

03:31.960 --> 03:32.790
What?

03:32.790 --> 03:34.830
I had to go home to get the locator.

03:35.880 --> 03:37.290
What?!

03:37.290 --> 03:39.710
Karen, you've got a screw loose...

03:40.170 --> 03:44.540
When the heck did she
put a tracker on me?!

03:44.540 --> 03:46.080
And where is it?!

03:46.750 --> 03:47.920
Hey, uh...

03:48.500 --> 03:51.580
Tsukishiro! She must be feeling better.

03:51.580 --> 03:57.170
Thank you for coming in here and
taking care of me when I wasn't feeling well.

03:57.710 --> 04:01.000
But Senpai is my dog!

04:01.000 --> 04:03.830
What?! Since when!

04:04.130 --> 04:06.330
Really? What gives you
the right to say that?

04:06.790 --> 04:09.960
Pochita belongs to me.

04:09.960 --> 04:20.040
He has 19,016,238 hairs on his furry body,
11,032,925 of which are brown!

04:20.040 --> 04:22.460
His tongue is 6.2 millimeters long,

04:22.460 --> 04:27.080
and when you lick his nose,
his tail swishes at 8 wags per second!

04:27.080 --> 04:30.210
He can hear sounds up to 45 meters away,

04:30.210 --> 04:32.130
and when he's excited, his breaths
alternate between "hah"s and "huff"s...

04:32.130 --> 04:33.630
You can stop now!
and when he's excited, his breaths<b>
</b>alternate between "hah"s and "huff"s...<b></b>

04:33.630 --> 04:35.040
and when he's excited, his breaths
alternate between "hah"s and "huff"s...

04:35.040 --> 04:37.000
When he wants attention,

04:37.000 --> 04:41.880
he pretends to flop over
while staring right at my pretty panties,

04:41.880 --> 04:47.540
then wriggles himself into
a better position to see up into my skirt!

04:47.540 --> 04:50.170
Please, have mercy! I can't take it anymore!

04:50.170 --> 04:52.330
F-fine, then do you have proof?

04:52.330 --> 04:55.130
Something that shows he's yours?!

04:58.960 --> 05:03.540
If I tell Pochita to "go home"
he'll run into my skirt!

05:04.040 --> 05:07.040
I'll go home, sweet home, to Inukai-san!

05:08.040 --> 05:09.460
Oh, God.

05:09.460 --> 05:13.250
H-he does that to me, too!

05:13.250 --> 05:15.790
He also helped me out of my wet clothes,

05:15.790 --> 05:19.210
and he took off my bra and panties!

05:25.920 --> 05:28.500
You've got it all wrong, Inukai-san!

05:29.170 --> 05:31.920
She was wet, and not for
the reasons you're thinking!

05:34.710 --> 05:38.290
Wh-whatever! Pochita's my dog, okay?!

05:41.580 --> 05:44.750
Nuh-uh! Senpai belongs to me!

05:45.210 --> 05:47.960
Excuse me?! Get your hands off him!

05:47.960 --> 05:49.040
You first!

05:50.710 --> 05:53.000
I-I'm suffocating!

05:55.420 --> 05:57.130
Stop, guys!

05:57.130 --> 05:59.250
You're smothering him!

06:01.130 --> 06:06.000
Look, why don't you two do some kind of
test to prove who his owner is?

06:06.000 --> 06:07.250
A...

06:07.500 --> 06:08.670
Test?

06:12.540 --> 06:17.040
Okay, it's Karen vs. Tsukishiro
in the Come Home Battle!

06:17.580 --> 06:21.000
Wait, we've gotta be nuts to test it like this!

06:21.000 --> 06:22.830
Back me up, Pochita!

06:23.080 --> 06:25.460
I would if I could...

06:27.960 --> 06:32.290
Whoever Pochita goes up to, or into, wins!

06:33.290 --> 06:36.830
That'll make her his real owner!

06:38.750 --> 06:40.710
Ready... Go!

06:47.040 --> 06:50.080
The hell?! They're actually serious!

06:50.670 --> 06:52.920
C'mere, Pochita!

06:52.920 --> 06:55.460
This way, Senpai!

06:55.920 --> 06:57.500
C'mon, Pochita, you can come to me, sweetie!

06:57.500 --> 07:02.210
Thanks, but I'm gonna go straight to Inukai-san...
C'mon, Pochita, you can come to me, sweetie!<b></b>

07:02.210 --> 07:05.330
Right over here!

07:07.920 --> 07:09.540
Sorry, Tsukishiro.

07:10.290 --> 07:14.130
No! Senpai has to be mine!

07:14.960 --> 07:19.670
He's so wishy-washy and pathetic,
but so sweet...

07:20.210 --> 07:22.790
I can't let her win!

07:24.130 --> 07:25.920
Look what I have!

07:26.920 --> 07:28.750
Tsukishiro?!

07:28.750 --> 07:32.170
Where did you get that bone?
And where are you putting it?!

07:32.170 --> 07:34.830
Shove that any deeper and
you'll actually be getting boned!

07:40.790 --> 07:44.500
Looks like he's much more interested
in what I have to offer!

07:47.130 --> 07:48.630
Pochita...

07:49.750 --> 07:51.960
No fair!

07:53.630 --> 07:56.170
Hey! Don't be a sore loser!

07:56.170 --> 07:58.210
Pochita's my dog!

07:58.210 --> 07:59.540
No, he's mine!

08:11.040 --> 08:12.290
Got him!

08:12.750 --> 08:13.710
Crap!

08:13.710 --> 08:17.330
Yay! He put his face in mine instead!

08:18.580 --> 08:20.380
I've gotta do something,
or I'll end up living with Tsukishiro!

08:20.380 --> 08:22.330
You get to live with me now!
I've gotta do something,<b>
</b>or I'll end up living with Tsukishiro!<b></b>

08:22.330 --> 08:23.750
You get to live with me now!
But what can I do?!<b></b>

08:30.250 --> 08:33.630
She's crying 'cause I went into
Tsukishiro's skirt instead...

08:33.630 --> 08:34.580
Dammit!

08:35.540 --> 08:37.830
Now you're all mine, Senpai!

08:37.830 --> 08:40.250
What do you want for dinner tonight?
Something yummy?

08:40.250 --> 08:41.710
I'm yummy, too...

08:42.420 --> 08:46.080
You're so cute! So cute! So cute!

08:57.290 --> 08:58.830
Well, well...

08:59.960 --> 09:02.380
Oh, Tsukishiro?

09:02.380 --> 09:06.000
Did you use this to lure in Pochita?

09:06.000 --> 09:08.790
Huh? Uh, no, I just...

09:09.290 --> 09:12.290
Then Pochita needs to come this way.

09:15.170 --> 09:21.670
Since you clearly cheated,
I'm gonna hand the win to Karen!

09:23.420 --> 09:26.920
Yes! Thank goodness, Pochita...

09:27.580 --> 09:29.170
Inukai-san...

09:35.880 --> 09:37.500
I'm sorry, Tsukishiro.

09:38.250 --> 09:42.630
You might have the hots for me,
but I'll never be your dog!

09:43.750 --> 09:46.750
C'mon, let's go home, Pochita.

09:52.750 --> 09:59.580
That, and I don't ever wanna see
Inukai-san that sad ever again.

10:00.830 --> 10:05.130
I'm sorry I cheated, Inukai-senpai.

10:05.130 --> 10:07.790
I know I shouldn't have...

10:08.290 --> 10:10.380
But this isn't over...

10:11.710 --> 10:14.080
I'll get the better of you next time!

10:14.750 --> 10:15.920
Really?

10:17.960 --> 10:20.460
You'll never get my Pochita!

10:28.960 --> 10:32.710
This is the weirdest rivalry
I've ever heard of!

10:34.790 --> 10:38.420
Oh, sweet! The rain's stopped!

10:43.580 --> 10:45.210
Long story short,

10:45.790 --> 10:49.420
I ended up back with Inukai-san.

10:57.380 --> 10:59.540
Next time, you're mine!

11:02.580 --> 11:06.330
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:07.380 --> 11:09.960
Come home! Come home! Come home! Come home!

11:09.960 --> 11:12.210
Let's Go! Come Home, Boy!

11:12.380 --> 11:16.790
You're so cute, I can't help but love you!

11:16.790 --> 11:21.960
I'll take you home and make you happy,
so c'mere, boy!

11:21.960 --> 11:26.080
The secret moments when I pet and kiss you

11:26.460 --> 11:31.130
Are precious moments to be honest about my love

11:31.500 --> 11:33.670
This feeling I'm yearning for

11:34.040 --> 11:36.040
This feeling I've been hiding

11:36.580 --> 11:38.420
This feeling I've finally found

11:38.420 --> 11:40.080
Hear it now! Feel it now!

11:40.080 --> 11:42.080
I l-l-l-l-love you!

11:42.080 --> 11:45.790
I hope my feelings will reach you one day

11:45.960 --> 11:50.170
One day, when you look up and see me

11:50.170 --> 11:52.710
I wanna be number one in your puppy heart!

11:52.710 --> 11:55.580
From the bottom of my heart, I love you!
